SUMMARY:Shamanic Journey Circle with Terry Lynn Trapp
DESCRIPTION:Click Here to Save Your Seat! \nShamanic Journeying is an ancient practice\, that can open you up to your inner world. Whether you are new to journeying or have experience\, all are welcome. We will create a sacred space\, where you will be held in a container that is safe\, comfortable and full of unconditional love. We will call in the sacred directions\, the elements\, our guides\, and the spirit of reiki\, to support us on our journey. \nThe sound of the drum will carry you to a shamanic state of consciousness\, or non-ordinary reality\, where you will be able to connect with spiritual guides\, power animals\, plant spirits\, nature spirits\, wise teachers\, and more! You will receive guidance\, messages\, insights and healing. \nABOUT TERRY TRAPP \nShamanic Healing practices that I have trained in include:\nShamanic Reiki (Mayan\, Andean\, Siberian\, Tibetan & Western Shamanism)\, Contemporary Shamanism & the Andean Medicine Wheel with the Munay Ki Teachings\, Core Shamanism\, Mesoamerican Curanderismo\, and Usui Tibetan Reiki.\nI love to offer Healing Sessions\, teach Shamanic Reiki\, and Advanced Shamanic Practitioner classes\, plus Sacred Soul Energy Healing and Holistic Wellness Consultations.\nPlease visit her website for more information:\nwholespectrumwellness.org
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/shamanic-journey-circle-with-terry-lynn-trapp/
LOCATION:Energy Wave Center\, 120 PLeasant Hill Ave. N\, Suite 330\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults and teens,Adults only, 21 and older,Adults, generally,Education,Participatory,Spiritual
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Terry-Trapp-July-20-480-x-270.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Energy Wave Center":MAILTO:connect@energywavecenter.com
END:VEVENT
