SUMMARY:Life Blueprint Experience with Rei Blaser
DESCRIPTION:Have you been curious about the “why” behind your daily decisions? Or do you feel a lack of motivation for completing a creative project? Perhaps you live life with ease and “go with the flow”; yet does it happen with conscious intention ~ or do you ‘let life happen’. \nJoin me and discover the various life intentions that are at the heart of every action we choose. Whether it is to eat healthy or to pursue a new career\, the Life Blueprint Experience will bring some sweet ‘ah ha’ moments and connect you with the amazing life you live. \n  \nLife Blueprint Experience is developed by the coaching academy I am completing my certification with. \nThis is a structured workshop\, with a goal of supporting attendees to see clarity on why they make the choices they make and leave with greater conscious awareness of the meaning behind those choices; whether daily choices or ones leading to a greater goal in their lives. \nPlease bring a designated journal for organizing your thoughts\, or another writing book with pen. \nQuestions? Feel free to email me at \nhello(at)flourishwithrei.com \n 
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/life-blueprint-experience-with-rei-blaser/
LOCATION:Bliss Organic Day Spa\, 186 N Main St\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults and teens,Adults, generally,Participatory,Skill-Building Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Life-Blueprint-Sebtimes.png
GEO:38.4031679;-122.8250511
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Bliss Organic Day Spa 186 N Main St Sebastopol CA 95472 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=186 N Main St:geo:-122.8250511,38.4031679
END:VEVENT
