SUMMARY:Restorative Yamuna Body Rolling with Lucibel Nuñez
DESCRIPTION:Register HERE for this popular monthly Yamuna class.  July guest instructor is Lucibel Nuñez. \nRestorative Yamuna Body Rolling (YBR) releases tension in the body while creating strength and flexibility. Using a Yamuna ball\, we will anatomically roll through tight and misaligned muscles. This creates Body Sustainability by working out stiffness and improves range of motion by creating space in the body. YBR can help prevent injuries and heal breakdowns. \nABOUT YOUR INSTRUCTOR \nLucibel Nuñez brings over 16 years of experience in the fitness industry\, with a deep passion for movement\, healing\, and personal transformation. She previously owned and operated a group fitness studio in Santa Rosa for nine years\, where she cultivated a strong sense of community and empowering wellness experiences. For the past decade\, Lucibel has also worked as a transformational coach\, supporting both her own growth and that of others through intentional\, holistic practices. \nCurrently pursuing her Master’s degree in Marriage and Family Therapy\, Lucibel is expanding her work to integrate mental\, emotional\, and relational health with physical well-being. Her approach focuses on treating the whole person rather than isolated symptoms. In her Yamuna Body Rolling classes\, she creates a space that fosters alignment\, self-awareness\, and sustainable transformation from the inside out. \n 
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/yamuna-body-rolling-with-jacque-benton/
LOCATION:Energy Wave Center\, 120 PLeasant Hill Ave. N\, Suite 330\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults and teens,Adults, generally,Education,Exercise/Yoga,Health,Older adults generally, 60+,Participatory,Physical exercise
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Lucibel-Sebtimes-July-19.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Energy Wave Center":MAILTO:connect@energywavecenter.com
END:VEVENT
